00:01:30,880 --> 00:01:35,880
and we get minus 0.25 W raised to the minus 1.5.

38
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:39,920
All right, and then, if we go and simplify that,

39
00:01:39,920 --> 00:01:44,280
we get 0.5 W to the negative one, right?

40
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:46,680
And what this says is that with this utility function,

41
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:49,720
you have positive risk aversion.

