00:01:53,800 --> 00:01:56,360
greater than zero indicates risk aversion.

45
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:58,640
Zero indicates no risk aversion.

46
00:01:58,640 --> 00:02:01,920
Negative indicates that you're risk preferring, right?

47
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,400
This also says something interesting

48
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,360
about this utility function,

49
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:06,960
which is that the bigger your wealth,

