00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:08,840
what happens, as your wealth goes up,

51
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:11,080
what happens to your degree of risk aversion?

52
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:17,920
So, this is the same as 0.5 over W.

53
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:23,920
So, as wealth increases, what happens to your risk aversion?

54
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,480
It goes down, it goes down, right?

55
00:02:26,480 --> 00:02:29,480
And as W goes to infinity, what happens to risk aversion?

