57
00:02:31,720 --> 00:02:33,800
So, this says that as your wealth becomes infinite,

58
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:37,240
then your risk aversion becomes non-existent, all right?

59
00:02:37,240 --> 00:02:39,120
So, with this utility function,

60
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,080
you're definitely risk averse.

61
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,720
You risk aversion all levels of wealth,

